    {
      "id": "2052032133724799212",
      "text": "\"Skills push the agent through the same phases a senior engineer forces themselves through, because shipping the code without them is how you produce incidents.\" https://t.co/7Jvq1OeVl7 &lt; @addyosmani's popular skills encode key parts of Google's engineering culture.",
